      ":question/id": "945d4e42-e131-5958-8aed-5486accd9a01",
      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-130111",
      ":question/problem": "Let $S=UV.$ What is the value of ${s}_{13}$, if\n\n$$\nU=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,V=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 10 & 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Multiplying the $1$st row in $U$ by the $3$rd column in $V$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{s}_{13} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 10 & 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot 3+3\\cdot (-2)+(-1)\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =-6-6+5 \\\\  & =-7.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    },
