      ":question/id": "131c2176-2405-5c54-b473-9fb3958cf472",
      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-130120",
      ":question/problem": "Let $D=AB.$ What is the value of ${d}_{24}$, if\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3 & -3\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Multiplying the $2$nd row in $A$ by the $4$th column in $B$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{d}_{24} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-3)+4\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =-9+4+3 \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    },
