      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-275547",
      ":question/problem": "Let $L=MN.$ What is the value of ${l}_{22}$, if\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,N=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$\n\n${l}_{22}=$\n{{field-1}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Multiplying the $2$nd row in $M$ by the $2$nd column in $N$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{l}_{22} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =4\\cdot 2+2\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =8+6 \\\\  & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    },
